tion or setup required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is PlayCode free to use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, PlayCode is free to use. You can write JavaScript code, use npm packages, create multi-file projects, and share your work via public URLs without paying anything. Pro features like AI assistance, private projects, and custom domains are available for subscribers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to sign up or install anything?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No signup required to start coding. Simply open PlayCode in your browser and start writing JavaScript immediately. All code runs directly in your browser, so there's nothing to install. You can optionally create an account to save projects and access them across devices."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use npm packages in the playground?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! PlayCode supports over 2 million npm packages. Simply import any package like React, Vue, Lodash, or Axios, and our JavaScript playground fetches and bundles it automatically. No npm install command needed. Popular packages are cached for instant loading."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What frameworks are supported?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlayCode supports all major JavaScript frameworks and libraries: React, Vue, Angular, Svelte, Solid.js, TypeScript, and vanilla JavaScript. You can also use CSS frameworks like Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, and Material UI. The playground comes pre-configured with all necessary tooling."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I share my JavaScript code?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Share your JavaScript playground project via a simple URL, or publish it to a live website with one click. Every project gets a unique playcode.io URL that anyone can access. Pro users can connect custom domains and deploy production websites directly from the playground."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the JavaScript playground work on mobile?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, PlayCode works on any device. The web-based JavaScript playground is optimized for tablets and smartphones, with touch-friendly controls and mobile-responsive layout. You can also download native desktop apps for Mac, Windows, and Linux for the best performance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the AI coding assistant work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PlayCode's AI assistant understands your entire project and can write code, fix bugs, explain errors, and create complete features. Just describe what you want to build, and the AI generates working JavaScript code with proper npm imports and file structure. It's like pair programming with an expert developer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I publish my project to a live website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Click the Publish button and your JavaScript playground project becomes a live website instantly. No deployment configuration, no hosting provider, no server setup. PlayCode handles hosting, SSL certificates, and CDN automatically. You can connect custom domains to create professional websites."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is my code stored in the cloud?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your code is stored locally in your browser by default. When you create an account, projects sync to the cloud so you can access them from any device. All data is encrypted and private by default. You control sharing permissions for each project."}}]},{"@type":"HowTo","name":"How to Use PlayCode JavaScript Playground","description":"Learn how to use PlayCode JavaScript playground in 5 simple steps. From selecting templates to publishing your project.","step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Quick Start from a Template","text":"Start instantly using pre-made templates. Over 2 million npm packages available from the start. Choose from React, Vue, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and more.","position":1},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"See Results as You Type","text":"Experience the fastest coding experience with instant live preview. Observe results as you type with hot module replacement.","position":2},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Debug in Console","text":"Use the powerful JavaScript console to debug your code. See logs, errors, and warnings in real-time.","position":3},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Collaborate in Real-Time","text":"Conduct coding interviews or create together with others from anywhere in the world, on any device. Multiple users can edit simultaneously.","position":4},{"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Deploy and Share Your Project","text":"Make your projects live with just one click. With zero setup and custom domains, sharing your web apps has never been simpler.","position":5}]}]}}}</script>
